      "value": "Requirements extracted from Zimmermann Functional Requirements excel, downloaded July 3rd, 2026 after all requirements were confirmed. Req ID prefix: **GC**.\n\n⚠️ **Rows with strikethrough are out of scope** — struck through in the Excel source file.\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Req ID | Functional Area | Sub-Functional Area | Requirement | Owner | Storefront | Status | Comments | User Story Link |\n| GC-001 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Physical Gift Card | The system will allow customers to purchase a physical or digital gift card by selecting an amount from fixed denominations ($100, $200, $250, $300, $500), entering sender name, recipient name, recipient email address, a delivery date, and an optional personal message. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-001> |\n| GC-002 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Physical Gift Card | The system will present the amount selection as a searchable dropdown showing fixed denominations. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-002> |\n| GC-003 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Digital Gift Card | The system will allow customers to purchase a physical or digital gift card by selecting an amount from fixed denominations ($100, $200, $250, $300, $500), entering sender name, recipient name, recipient email address, a delivery date, and an optional personal message. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-003> |\n| GC-004 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Digital Gift Card | The system will present the amount selection as a searchable dropdown showing fixed denominations. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-004> |\n| GC-005 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Digital Gift Card | The system will display a date picker calendar for the delivery date field, allowing the customer to navigate between months and select a future delivery date. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-005> |\n| GC-006 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Digital Gift Card | The system will restrict the delivery date selection to within 3 months from the current date; dates beyond 3 months will be greyed out and unavailable for selection. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-006> |\n| GC-007 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Digital Gift Card | The system will validate the recipient email address field on the Digital Gift Card PDP to ensure it is in a valid email format before the customer can add to bag. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-007> |\n| GC-008 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | PDP - Digital Gift Card | The system will allow the sender and recipient to be the same person; the customer may enter their own name and email address as both sender and recipient. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-008> |\n| GC-009 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Mini Cart - Physical & Digital Gift Cards | The system will display the gift card in the mini cart showing: gift card image, price, and quantity only. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-009> |\n| GC-010 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Mini Cart - Physical & Digital Gift Cards | The system will provide MOVE TO WISHLIST (Physical cards only) and REMOVE actions on the gift card line item in the mini cart. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-010> |\n| GC-011 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Digital Gift Card | The system will display the digital gift card in the full cart showing gift card image, price, quantity, sender name, recipient name, recipient email, delivery date, and message. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-011> |\n| GC-012 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Digital Gift Card | The system will allow the customer to adjust the quantity of the gift card in the cart. | Dependent SF Functionality | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-012> |\n| GC-013 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Digital Gift Card | The system will provide EDIT, ~~MOVE TO WISHLIST~~, and REMOVE actions on the gift card line item in the cart (note: edit function is exclusive to digital gift cards) | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-013> |\n| GC-014 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Cart - Digital Gift Card | The system will navigate the customer back to the Digital Gift Card PDP with all previously entered details pre-populated when the customer selects EDIT from the cart. | Accenture |