nly) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-030> |\n| GC-031 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Payment - All Cart Combinations | The system will hide the gift card payment method at checkout if a physical or digital gift card is already present in the cart | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-031> |\n| GC-032 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Checkout - Order Confirmation | The system will trigger order confirmation communications via Narvar for all domestic orders | NewStore | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-032> |\n| GC-033 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Checkout - Order Confirmation | The system will trigger order confirmation communications via Global-e for all international orders | Tryzens | EU, US, HK, ME (International only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-033> |\n| GC-034 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will display a gift card number field and a PIN field when the Gift Card payment tab is selected. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-034> |\n| GC-035 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will require the customer to enter both a gift card number and PIN before applying | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-035> |\n| GC-036 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will treat credit note entry and redemption at checkout identically to gift cards - the same card number and PIN entry mechanism applies with no distinction between the two | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-036> |\n| GC-037 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will display a CHECK BALANCE link at the gift card entry field, allowing the customer to verify their available balance before applying. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-037> |\n| GC-038 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will display instructional text prompting the customer to click Apply after entering each gift card. | Zimmermann | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-038> |\n| GC-039 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will validate the gift card number and PIN against GiveX in real time when the customer selects APPLY, returning the available balance and applying it against the order total | Accenture (direct integration to Give-X) | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20GC-039> |\n| GC-040 | Gift Cards & Credit Notes | Redeeming a Gift Card/Credit Note - Gift Card Entry | The system will allow a customer to remove an applied gift card or credit note from checkout and revert to another payment method | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US (Domestic only) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimme